  <h2 class="section-title">Election To Exclude Church Employees From FICA Coverage</h2>
  <p>Churches and qualified church-controlled organizations may elect to exclude their employees from FICA coverage. This election must be made by the church or organization.</p>
  <p>You may also choose to exclude certain employees from FICA coverage. For more information, see <span data-field="section_ref">{{ section_ref }}</span>.</p>

  <h2 class="section-title">Election by Church Employees to Exclude from Social Security and Medicare</h2>
  <p>You may be able to choose to be exempt from social security and Medicare taxes. This election must be made by you, the employee.</p>
  <p>You can make this choice by filing Form <span data-field="form_number">{{ form_number }}</span>.</p>
  <p>If you make this election, you will not be subject to social security and Medicare taxes on the earnings you receive from the church or religious organization.</p>

  <h2 class="section-title">U.S. Citizens and Resident Aliens</h2>
  <p>To be covered under the SE tax provisions, you must be a U.S. citizen or a resident alien of the United States. Nonresident aliens are not subject to SE tax.</p>

  <h2 class="section-title">Exemption From Self-Employment (SE) Tax</h2>
  <p>You can request an exemption from SE tax if you are one of the following:</p>
  <ol>
    <li>A minister.</li>
    <li>A member of a religious order who has taken a vow of poverty.</li>
    <li>A Christian Science practitioner or reader.</li>
  </ol>

  <h3 class="subsection-title">Table 2. Self-Employment Tax Exception Application and Approval Process</h3>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>How</th>
        <th>When</th>
        <th>Approval</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>File Form 4029</td>
        <td>By the due date (plus extensions) of your tax return for the year in which you had at least $400 of net earnings from self-employment.</td>
        <td>If approved, you will receive an approval letter from the IRS.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>File Form 4029</td>
        <td>First day of first quarter after the year in which you had at least $400 of net earnings from self-employment.</td>
        <td>If approved, you will receive an approval letter from the IRS.</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

